The TRS-80 App Authors
======================

The source files in this project carry a collective copyright notice reading
"The TRS-80 App Authors". This file is what that refers to: the people who have
contributed to the project, in the order they first did so.

Arno Puder
Sascha Haeberling
Robert Corrigan

Contributors are welcome to add themselves here as part of a contribution.
The authoritative record of who wrote what is the git history; this file
exists so the copyright notice points at named people rather than nobody.


Third-party code
----------------

Parts of this repository are not covered by the notice above and keep the
copyright notices of their own authors. Those notices must not be changed.
They include, among others:

  * The xtrs emulator core under `app/src/main/c`, by Timothy Mann, and the
    Model I/III/4 emulation it builds on, by Clarendon Hill Software.
  * SDL, by Sam Lantinga.
  * Portions of the SDL interface layer, by Mark Grebe.
  * cJSON, by Dave Gamble and contributors.
  * The card flip animation under `app/src/main/java/com/tekle`, by
    Ephraim Tekle.
  * The drag-and-drop helpers under `app/src/main/java/org/puder/trs80/drag`,
    by Paul Burke.

See each file's own header for the applicable notice and licence.
